@startuml
title Enregistrement d'un Agent - Etape 2 : Activation du Juge (honeypot)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor white

participant "Backend"            as API
database    "PostgreSQL"         as DB
participant "ValidationRegistry" as VR   #LightBlue
participant "Container du juge"  as JC   #LightYellow
participant "Frontend"           as Client

note over API, JC
  Suite de l'Etape 1 pour les agents de type JUGE uniquement.
  Lance en tache de fond depuis POST /confirm (~25s).
end note

== Test technique ==

API  ->>  JC  : lancerContainer(tacheDeTest)
activate JC

JC   ->   API : demanderTache(judgeId)
activate API
API  -->  JC  : fournirTrace(executionTrace)
deactivate API

JC   ->   API : soumettreResultat(judgeId, score, resultCID)
activate API

alt Test reussi
    API  ->  VR  : enregistrerResultat(judgeId, pass=true, resultCID)
    activate VR
    VR   -->  API : HoneypotPassed(judgeId, resultCID)
    deactivate VR
    API  ->  DB  : mettreAJourStatut(actif)
    activate DB
    DB   -->  API : ok
    deactivate DB

else Test echoue
    API  ->  VR  : enregistrerResultat(judgeId, pass=false, resultCID)
    activate VR
    VR   -->  API : HoneypotFailed(judgeId, resultCID)
    deactivate VR
    API  ->  DB  : mettreAJourStatut(validationEchouee)
    activate DB
    DB   -->  API : ok
    deactivate DB
end

API  -->  JC  : ack
deactivate API
deactivate JC

@enduml
